# bcunit 于 ohpcd 的可用性证据（bctoolbox 5.3.115 任务）

## 2026-09-05 首轮（当时结论：未发布）

```
$ conan list "bcunit/*" -r=ohpcd
Connecting to remote 'ohpcd' anonymously
Found 0 pkg/version recipes matching bcunit/* in ohpcd
ohpcd
  WARN: There are no matching recipe references
```

→ 当时 `ENABLE_TESTS_COMPONENT` 必须关闭，上游 tester 35 用例记 NOT_RUN(未编译)，人工复审 rule4 判不通过。

